{"id":"n62539-2-9","stage":1,"title":"다시 · 再","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62539-2-9-1","ko":"실험에서 왜 자꾸 실패를 하지?","zh":"为什么实验总是失败呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실험에서","meaning":"实验","explanation":"실험：实验；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"실험","audio":"/audio/59a4e3135e4e1d8fcde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14132","senseId":"2","lemma":"실험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실패를","meaning":"失败","explanation":"실패：失败；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실패","audio":"/audio/2743911f83e1da696cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64948","senseId":"1","lemma":"실패","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"59a4e3135e4e1d8f","term":"실험","zh":"实验","audio":"/audio/59a4e3135e4e1d8fcde2.mp3","entryId":"14132","definition":"为了确认某个科学理论正确与否而在一定的条件或状况下观察和测定该现象。","pronunciation":["실험"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"2743911f83e1da69","term":"실패","zh":"失败","audio":"/audio/2743911f83e1da696cb0.mp3","